; One variable: the orange box is a Node3D under a moved, hidden Node2D. A Node3D below a node that
; is no Node3D is a root of the world (node_3d.cpp:150), so the box draws beside the grey reference,
; neither moved nor hidden. No other golden puts a Node3D below a CanvasItem in the 3D view, so a box
; dropped below its 2D parent shows only here.

